failed to bootstrap application: 1 problem

[1] duplicate global enhancer
    `AppGuard<RootGuard>` is declared by several instances of Realm, so it would run once per instance on every route:
      - Realm#1, imported by App
      - Realm#2, imported by App
    hint: declare it in a module imported once, such as the root module, or merge the instances with `Module::identity`.
